{"id": "support-037", "category": "yield", "group_id": "yield", "question": "需要在数据库依赖结束后关闭会话时，应该用 yield 还是 return？", "reference_answer": "使用 yield，并在后面编写清理步骤。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.115.0"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.115.0/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.115.0/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield.md", "quote": "为此，你需要使用 `yield` 而不是 `return`，然后再编写这些额外的步骤（代码）。", "start_char": 164, "end_char": 211}], "split": "development", "review_status": "unreviewed", "authorship": "assistant_draft_from_pinned_docs", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": ""}
