{"id": "support-039", "category": "yield", "group_id": "yield", "question": "带 yield 的依赖怎样保证异常时也执行退出步骤？", "reference_answer": "使用 finally 确保退出步骤执行。", "should_answer": true, "expected_status": "answered", "filters": {"product": "fastapi", "version": "0.115.0"}, "relevant_sources": ["fastapi/0.115.0/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield.md"], "evidence": [{"source": "fastapi/0.115.0/tutorial/dependencies/dependencies-with-yield.md", "quote": "同样，你也可以使用 `finally` 来确保退出步骤得到执行，无论是否存在异常。", "start_char": 1481, "end_char": 1522}], "split": "development", "review_status": "unreviewed", "authorship": "assistant_draft_from_pinned_docs", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": ""}
